Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 22:44:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03356/11362] [outer-loop] arc: commit hard-tail diagnostic
 instrumentation + e3 induced-model artifacts

ARC deliverables from the hard-tail attack: results/diag_hardtail_{bfs,deep,exploration}.json +
scripts/diag_hardtail_*.py (the failure-mode workflow agent's systematic-BFS/exploration instrumentation
that classified the tail as STRUCTURE-bound), the regenerated results/arc_e3/{r11l,sp80,cd82}/world_model.py
induced models, and the latest arc_compete_sim.json harness output. Also sweeps incidental timestamp-only
churn in results/experiment_6{25,38,45}_tier1_fr11_relay.json (run_date/started_at re-stamped by the
offline-arcade side-effect; content + reproducibility_checksum unchanged -- not substantive edits).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
